            "acceptanceCriteria": "Data model classes created with relationships, validation, and business logic + compilation successful + classes properly implemented + contract test files created + model test files created + integration test files created + all tests fail as expected (RED status) + comprehensive test coverage. Verify ALL 8 requirements before marking complete!",
